  Sender: 1
  Lines:
  - 'You see what happens when you act on your own, Danny?'
  - 'Max couldn''t handle the workload. He''s been demoted.'
  - 'But you have an advantage.'
  - 'You are being guided by {name}.'
  - 'A good employee. Choose the right friends.'
  - 'Come down to the first floor. We need to close your shared file.'
